  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "句法學",
    "sub_ename": "SYNTAX",
    "describe_ch": "對英文句法結構基本概念的認識，及培養學生對句法現象歸納分析的能力。語料來源以英文為主，其他外國語之相關資料為輔。修習之學生可藉由句法學的知識與原理，應用於分析英文之句法結構，以增進其英文句法結構的解析能力與運用。",
    "describe_eh": "This course will provide students with an understanding of the basic concepts of and analytical tools for the study of sentence structure. The emphasis will be placed on not only English syntax but also the basics of argumentation. The current Chomskyan theory will be covered as well. Broadly, the topics in this course include: lexical information, the basic of phrase structure grammar, different types of clauses, movement, and dependency relations. Problems and discussion will mainly focus on English. Some other languages in addition to English will be covered as well.\r\n\r\n",
